WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.070
Today your child learns to say a short word all at once.

2
00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:10.332
Watch first. The first one on the page is done for you: show it, do the next one together, and your child does the rest.

3
00:00:10.832 --> 00:00:13.412
Watch first. Then do the same with your child.

4
00:00:13.912 --> 00:00:18.845
First, the way your child reads now. Touch each dot, and say each sound out loud.

5
00:00:21.973 --> 00:00:23.009
The word is cat.

6
00:00:23.909 --> 00:00:29.167
Now the same word again. Touch the dots, but say the sounds in your head. Lips closed.

7
00:00:31.717 --> 00:00:32.753
The word is cat.

8
00:00:33.553 --> 00:00:38.165
The sounding out does not stop. It just goes quiet. That is the whole move.

9
00:00:38.615 --> 00:00:42.946
Do the four words in job one this way. Out loud first, then in your head.

10
00:00:43.396 --> 00:00:47.332
Do not ask for fast. Ask for quiet sounds, and one clear word.

11
00:00:47.782 --> 00:00:54.376
For job two, press play on your child's listening track and step away. The voice waits, then says each word.

12
00:00:54.826 --> 00:00:58.947
At the end, your child says three words to you all at once. Mark each one.
